  <h2>2. What Genobills is and what it isn't</h2>
  <p>
    Genobills lets you manually log your accounts, income, expenses, budgets and goals, see
    summaries and insights about that information, and log transfers with other users you link with.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>It's not a bank or a financial institution.</strong> We don't receive, hold, transfer
      or manage money. “Transfers” between linked people are only records in the app: they don't
      move real money.
    </li>
    <li><strong>We don't connect to your bank accounts.</strong> Everything in the app is what you entered or imported.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>We don't give advice.</strong> Summaries, charts, budgets and notices are informational
